* Glove v3 representative one-cell PVDF readout
* Nominal: 3.3 V rail, 1.25 V Vmid, 531 pF full 10 x 14 mm PVDF blank plus 150 pF cable, 22 Mohm || 470 pF charge feedback.
* All three amplifiers use the fetched MCP6001/2/4 macro-model.
.title One-cell PVDF charge amplifier and two Sallen-Key stages
.param VDDVAL=3.3 VBIAS=1.25 CPV=531p CABLEVAL=150p IPULSEV=-1u RFBV=22Meg CFBV=470p
VDD vdd 0 {VDDVAL}
VBIAS vmi 0 {VBIAS}
CPVDF nsense 0 {CPV}
CCABLE nsense 0 {CABLEVAL}
RIN nsense nin 100000
* A250uA pulse with100ns ramps and900ns flat injects250pC.
IAC 0 nsense DC 0 AC 1
IPULSE 0 nsense PULSE(0 {IPULSEV} 80m 100n 100n 900n 1s)
XCA vmi nin vdd 0 nca MCP6001
RFB nca nin {RFBV}
CFB nca nin {CFBV}

* Stage 1: 14.7k / 14.7k, 12 nF feedback, 10 nF to Vmid.
R1A nca n1 14.7k
R1B n1 n2 14.7k
C1FB n1 s1out 12n
C1G n2 vmi 10n
XSK1 n2 s1out vdd 0 s1out MCP6001

* Stage 2: 27.4k / 27.4k, 15 nF feedback, 2.2 nF to Vmid.
R2A s1out n3 27.4k
R2B n3 n4 27.4k
C2FB n3 s2out 15n
C2G n4 vmi 2.2n
XSK2 n4 s2out vdd 0 s2out MCP6001


.include MCP6001-original.lib
.options method=gear reltol=1e-4 abstol=1e-12 gmin=1e-13 maxord=2 itl1=500 itl4=100
.temp 27

COUTPUT s2out 0 5p

.ic v(nsense)=1.25 v(nin)=1.25 v(nca)=1.25 v(n1)=1.25 v(n2)=1.25 v(s1out)=1.25 v(n3)=1.25 v(n4)=1.25 v(s2out)=1.25

.include BAV199-equations.lib
DCLP nin vmi BAV199
DCLN vmi nin BAV199

.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 2u 0.2 0 1u
wrdata /tmp/glove-eda-runtime/analog-v32/canonical--1pC.dat v(nca) v(s1out) v(s2out) v(nin) v(nsense)
quit
.endc
.end
